{"id":"659755","name":"糯叽叽菠萝蜜麻糍","author":"鱼菲","authorId":"2270985","desc":"","cover":"images/659755/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"菠萝蜜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"糯米粉","amount":"80克"},{"name":"玉米淀粉","amount":"15克"},{"name":"牛奶","amount":"130毫升"},{"name":"白糖","amount":"15克"},{"name":"黄油","amount":"10克"}],"sub":[{"name":"新西兰花生酱","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备食材。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/30/2024063017197596798897392270985.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":2,"desc":"将牛奶与白糖加入粉中。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/30/2024063017197602425515512270985.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":3,"desc":"混合搅拌均匀，过滤后盖上保鲜膜扎洞。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/30/2024063017197602483384122270985.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":4,"desc":"然后沸水上锅，中小火蒸20分钟。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/30/2024063017197602586915772270985.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":5,"desc":"菠萝蜜去核备用。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/30/2024063017197602691488552270985.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":6,"desc":"糯米团取出后放入黄油，趁热揉至完全融合，冷藏半个小时后分成等份。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/30/2024063017197602729229462270985.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":7,"desc":"包入花生酱，然后夹入菠萝蜜中即可。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/30/2024063017197602777677292270985.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":8,"desc":"糯叽叽菠萝蜜麻糍，就问你想不想吃。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/30/2024063017197602825146592270985.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p320"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}